    { "id": "fa-pedar", "label": "پدر", "latin": "pedar", "lang": "fa", "langLabel": "Persian", "gloss": "father", "notes": "From Middle Persian 'pidar' (𐭓𐭐𐭃), from Old Persian 'pitā' (𐎱𐎡𐎫𐎠), from Proto-Iranian *ptā́, from PIE *ph₂tḗr — cognate with English 'father' and German 'Vater'." },
